Ghost Recon breakpoint is adding a free  immersive mode with its next update  here's everything you need to know about  the new experience plus another visit  from none other than Sam Fisher the new  update is called the ghost experience  and it lets you play break point in  three different ways  regular is the default mode with the  gear score and tiered loot you're used  to immersive mode has well none of that  then there's custom mode which lets you  tweak the rules of regular and immersive  modes to your liking let's talk about  those rules with immersive mode  specifically there's no gear level you  could be customizing the same weapon for  the whole campaign no quality tiers or  levels you can choose one or two primary  weapons and loot additional guns from  fallen enemies you can swap one of yours  for the one they drop reloading is also  more realistic if you reload your gun  with bullets still left in the magazine  you'll lose them additionally immersive  mode limits your health regeneration and  gets rid of most of the HUD regen and  HUD are some of the rules you can toggle  in custom mode to along with your  stamina level risk of injury from enemy  bullets and number of bandages you can  carry you can also turn on private mode  meaning you'll only encounter Story  characters and your own co-op partners  in erawan no matter which mode you  choose you'll still be able to play  online with friends lastly you can  toggle Maria's shop letting you access  it from bivouacs  or from within Erewhon only coming  alongside this big update is another  Splinter Cell crossover mission called  deep State the trailer features Sam  Fisher who's come to the islands to  extract a target known as the strategist  like the update this mission is also  free for all breakpoint players stay  tuned to game spot for some upcoming  impressions of immersive mode and we'll  see you on our own  [Music]
 

